    {
      "id": "claim_37d93a069f6644dd9ca4fccfce37d8ee",
      "statement": "For OpenAI-compatible streaming, `stream_ai_text` forwards each SSE content delta to the caller as it arrives, counts `reasoning_content` separately, retries an empty completion once, and never retries after any content has already been emitted.",
